Understanley reimplements Understand Anything's analysis pipeline and dashboard in
Swift. No upstream source code is bundled or copied verbatim; the algorithms,
the knowledge-graph schema, and the visual language are ported, and the on-disk
format (`.ua/knowledge-graph.json`) is deliberately kept byte-compatible so
graphs move freely between the two projects in either direction.

Where this port diverges from upstream is documented in README.md.

